# Environment template — TAD §18.5.
#
# This project has NO secrets (invariant I3). Only non-sensitive,
# build-time configuration lives here. Copy to .env for local overrides;
# .env itself is git-ignored.
#
# Canonical site URL. In production Netlify provides the deploy URL;
# astro.config.mjs falls back to the subdomain placeholder (assumption B7).
SITE_URL=https://harshit-portfolio-hub.netlify.app
